Enable basic instruction tracking for arm64 by implementing three
essential functions in the find_data_type_block() call path:

  find_data_type_block
    -> arch_supports_insn_tracking  (1)
    -> find_data_type_insn
         -> init_type_state         (2)
         -> update_insn_state       (3)

