Add a helper function thc_rxdam_reset() to do read DMA reset, it can be
called when fatal DMA error happens.

Signed-off-by: Even Xu <even.xu@intel.com>
---
 .../intel-thc-hid/intel-thc/intel-thc-dma.c   | 37 +++++++++++++++++++
